  "releaseNotes": "0.8.1\n- Improve performance and reduce package size\n- Improve compatibility across supported platforms\n- Strengthen release packaging checks\n\n\n0.8.0\n- Harden native CLD2 bindings with explicit input lengths and null-pointer checks\n- Improve native cleanup for empty or failed prediction results\n- Remove the forced MSVC AVX2 flag for broader Windows CPU compatibility\n- Add NuGet package icon and expanded package tags",
